36
00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:42.878
At recess Tyler pushed Caroline on the swing.

37
00:02:42.879 --> 00:02:53.107
And the Valentine's Day heart sang, "Valentine's Day, Valentine's Day, what a happy day to play!

38
00:02:53.108 --> 00:03:01.404
